            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, it is the most DIY-friendly driveway type, but it is heavy work. You will likely need to rent a skid steer or compact track loader and a plate compactor, and have stone delivered by dump truck. Small resurfacing jobs are easily DIY; new builds on soft soil or with culverts are often worth hiring out."
