            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Crusher run and recycled crushed concrete are often the cheapest per ton and also among the best surfaces because they compact hard. Prices depend heavily on what local quarries and recyclers produce, so ask a nearby supply yard what they sell as a driveway top layer and base stone, and compare delivered prices."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do I need landscape fabric under gravel?",
